As long as I'm not Mattis' child, I'm never coming home!

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:43.070
<i>Ronja told Klippen that she would not return to the fort with him.</i>

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:51.920
<i>Then one summer afternoon, they were attacked by a flock of wild harpies while playing in the river.</i>

00:01:52.830 --> 00:02:00.430
